config VENUS_FREQ
    tristate "Venus Frequency QoS Control for Xiaomi Venus (SM8350)"
    depends on CPU_FREQ
    default m
    help
      Provides persistent per-cluster CPU frequency min/max control via
      high-priority PM QoS requests. Designed to survive mi_thermald and
      msm_performance overrides on Xiaomi Venus (SM8350) devices.
      Exposes sysfs interface at /sys/kernel/venus_freq/policy{N}/

      PM QoS frequency constraints live in kernel/power/qos.c, which is
      linked unconditionally in this tree (obj-y), so CPU_FREQ is the only
      hard dependency. freq_qos_add_request / update / remove are all
      EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL and therefore reachable from this module.
